<title>THAILAND: Thai sugar vessel movements on Jan 13.</title>
<headline>Thai sugar vessel movements on Jan 13.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed Thai sugar freight movement as follows (in tonne tel quels):</p>
<p>Vessel		Position	     Quantity    Destination</p>
<p>Oun Chong Nyon Ho  SLD Jan 01	   2,175	 North Korea</p>
<p>Kapitan Shevchenko SLD Jan 03	  13,000	 Japan</p>
<p>Pakarti Sembilan   SLD Jan 05	   5,250	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Kapitan Tsirul     ETR Dec 28	  15,300	 Japan</p>
<p>Hong QI 206	  SLD Jan 05	  18,000	 Japan</p>
<p>Ivan Makarin	 ETD Jan 07	  17,850	 Japan</p>
<p>Great Concert	ETD Jan 07	  13,200	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Ais Mamas	    ETD Jan 08	  13,300	 S.Korea</p>
<p>Pitak Samut	  ETD Jan 09	  14,300	 Japan</p>
<p>Botsman Moshkov    ETD Jan 14	  12,000	 Russia</p>
<p>Yon Pung Ho	  ETD Jan 18	  12,000	 Sri Lanka</p>
<p>Pichai Samut	 ETR Jan 12	  18,000	 Japan</p>
<p>Kum Gang	     ARRD Dec 21	 12,000	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Bangpo		 ETR Jan 07	   2,300	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Feng Yang	    ETA Jan 04	  13,000	 Sri Lanka</p>
<p>Alam Teladan	 ETA Jan 08	  15,000	 Malaysia</p>
<p>Bangramard	   ETR Jan 08-09	6,000	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Jin Gang Ling	ETA Jan 06	   4,700	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Kwan Mo Bong	 ETD Jan 08	   8,000	 Malaysia</p>
<p>Billion		ETA Jan 08	   7,200	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Hun Jiang	    ETA Jan 09	  12,000	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Kapitan Bakanov    ARRD Jan 06	 13,100	 Japan</p>
<p>Liberty		ETA Jan 06-10	5,000	 Vietnam</p>
<p>Galactica	    ETA Jan 10	  14,300	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Tropical Rose	ETA Jan 06-10	1,500	 Cambodia</p>
<p>Sonamai		ETR Jan 07	   1,000	 Cambodia</p>
<p>Hui Feng	     ETR Jan 07	  10,000	 S. Korea</p>
<p>Man Ni II	    ETA Jan 06	   2,000	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Orient Express     ETA Jan 08	   1,140	 Cambodia</p>
<p>Sangthai Radium    ETA Jan 08-09	1,000	 Singapore</p>
<p>Tong Chuan	   ETA Jan 10	  12,600	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Alam Tangkas	 ETA Jan 16	  12,000	 Malaysia</p>
<p>Yong Gun Bong	ETR Jan 10-11	8,000	 Indonesia</p>
<p>European Confidence ETR Jan 08	 10,000	 S.Korea</p>
<p>An Gi Jiang	  ETA Jan 14	   4,500	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Prapti		 ETA Jan 15	  12,000	 Dubai</p>
<p>Jin Chen Jiang     ETR Jan 13	  12,000	 Indonesia</p>
<p>Feng Hang	    L/CAN Jan 15-20   12,000	 Tanzania</p>
<p>Su Ling		ETA Jan 10-11	5,000	 Vietnam</p>
<p>NOTE: SLD indicates that the vessel has left, ETA = Estimated Time of Arrival, ETD = Estimated Time of Departure, ETR = Estimated Time of Readiness, L/CAN indicated period when vessels are expected in for loading or be cancelled.</p>
